\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelWellFoundedRelation}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcRelExtensionalRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelWellFoundedRelation}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcRelExtensionalRelation}_S\\)</span> (relation predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel10MostowskiCollapseTarget}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel10MostowskiCollapseTarget}_S\\)</span> (collapse-target predicate from dependency)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mostowski\\text{-}collapse}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRelWellFoundedRelation}_S(R,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelExtensionalRelation}_S(R,X)\n\\to\n\\exists!N\\;\\exists!\\pi\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel10MostowskiCollapseTarget}_S(N,X,R,\\pi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mostowski\\text{-}collapse}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRelWellFoundedRelation}_S(R,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelExtensionalRelation}_S(R,X)\n\\to\n\\exists!N\\;\\exists!\\pi\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel10MostowskiCollapseTarget}_S(N,X,R,\\pi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mostowski (1949): fundamental theorem for inner models.</li>\n<li>Every externally well-founded extensional membership structure has a transitive collapse.</li>\n<li>The collapse map preserves the relation by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"xRy \\leftrightarrow \\pi(x)\\in\\pi(y)\">\\(xRy \\leftrightarrow \\pi(x)\\in\\pi(y)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Used in: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>, inner models, forcing, countable transitive models.</li>\n<li>Key for: absoluteness, reflection, consistency proofs.</li>\n<li>Non-well-founded models: &quot;nonstandard&quot; models with infinite descending chains.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","leve